  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 31 ÷ 15 − 1017 × 9 + 22 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after ‘+’ and ‘−’ are interchanged and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged:\n\n31 ÷ 15 − 1017 × 9 + 22 = ? ⇒ 31 × 15 + 1017 ÷ 9 - 22 = ?\n\n⇒ 31 × 15 + __**1017 **____**÷**____** 9**__ - 22 = ?\n\n⇒ __**31 ×**____** 15**__ + 113 - 22 = ?\n\n⇒ __**465**____** + 113**__ - 22 = ?\n\n⇒ __**578**____** - 22**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 556 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
